OL,3,GNEWSANew Ouseburn footbridge over the
OL,4,ATyne proposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new footbridge could cross the River
OL,7,FTyne as part of proposed regeneration
OL,8,Fplans.
OL,10,FThe bridge would link Newcastle's
OL,11,FOuseburn to Gateshead, according to a
OL,12,Fdocument published by the North East
OL,13,FMSA which details its 25-year vision
OL,14,Ffor the region.
OL,16,FThe report suggested the bridge would
OL,17,F"extend the spirit of Ouseburn's
OL,18,Fheritage-led reinvention" to Gateshead.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
