OL,3,GNEWSANew Ouseburn footbridge over the
OL,4,ATyne proposed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe document will be presented to the
OL,7,Fcabinets of Newcastle and Gateshead
OL,8,Fcouncils next week, followed by the
OL,9,FNorth East MSA. The plans will then be
OL,10,Fsubject to a public consultation.
